WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.433
The drivers getting themselves ready
赛车手们都做好了准备

00:00:01.466 --> 00:00:03.700
Hello，I wonder who this man is
哟，我倒想知道这位是谁

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.000
Wang yibo getting himself ready
王一博正在做准备

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.700
Much to the cheers of the crowd
现场观众为他爆发出热烈的欢呼

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.600
They've gone ballistic
他们看见自己支持的偶像了

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.766
They've seen their boy
他们看到了他们的男孩

00:00:09.766 --> 00:00:13.600
And now that we've got this gap in the two sessions
现在，趁着两节比赛之间的这段空档

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.133
We can make out the cheers of the crowd
我们能清楚地听见观众的欢呼声

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.200
over the waft of the engines
甚至盖过了阵阵引擎声浪

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.233
The cars coming in
赛车进站了

00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:20.500
backed by Red Bull this season
本赛季他得到了红牛的支持

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.133
There you go
来了

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:23.733
Oh my word
我的天哪！

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.800
Several thousand spectators flocking into Shanghai
数千名观众涌入上海

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.066
and they've even been here since yesterday
有些人甚至从昨天起就守在这里了

00:00:30.066 --> 00:00:32.600
All very keen to keep an eye on this boy
大家都迫不及待地想关注这位车手

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:36.033
who i have to say really is stepping up to the plate
我必须说他确实正在迎接挑战

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:38.266
as a professional racing driver
逐渐展现出职业赛车手的水准

00:00:38.266 --> 00:00:39.466
Listen to that
听听这欢呼声

00:00:39.466 --> 00:00:43.566
I was actually in conversation with Elias Seppänen over the course of yesterday
昨天一整天，我其实都在和伊莱亚斯・塞帕宁沟通

00:00:43.566 --> 00:00:44.800
And one thing he stated about
他特别提到了一点

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.300
is he's worked with gentleman drivers before
来到小米·China GT中国超级跑车锦标赛后，尽管他以前也与绅士车手合作过

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.733
is he's worked with gentlemen drivers before
尽管他以前也与绅士车手合作过

00:00:49.733 --> 00:00:52.900
He's worked with drivers who are amateur level
也搭档过业余水平的车手

00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:56.466
But never before has he had the professionalism
但他从未见过如此专业的态度

00:00:56.466 --> 00:00:59.200
of the person sat next to him in the awning
无论是此刻坐在车队帐篷里他身旁的这位

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.000
and even the other amateur drivers in the teams
但他从未有过像雨篷上坐在他旁边的人甚至车队中其他业余车手那样的专业精神